Each additional COMMITTED activity needs a distinct goal/evidence contribution. Integrate explanation, supported application and an independent changed example where sufficient. Unknown readiness does not automatically require separate relearning, multiple practice sets and another check. Keep further remediation CONTINGENT on a concrete observed failure when an integrated task could already meet the goal cleanly. Choose contrasting examples from educational need, never spare time. For method-selection capability require correct method choice, valid selection reason and correct solution on changed course-appropriate work without assistance. Attempts/error logs are diagnostic evidence, not successful capability; record an unresolved gap honestly when performance fails. Do not assume advanced methods beyond the accepted taught repertoire. A method choice is valid when its actual assumptions/topology apply and it gives a correct solution; it need not match the reference solution's choice.
Criteria must be achievable and technically correct for the examples/parameters actually permitted. Allow clean diagnostic results without inventing errors or error-pattern counts. Never require an unconditional qualitative conclusion (such as one probability input dominating) that arbitrary changed parameters do not guarantee; specify valid conditions or a justified conditional explanation. Parse valid input correctly (a quoted comma is valid CSV); reject/explain only actual input-contract violations. Correct assigned results, explanation and checks matter, not a log of attempts. Effort/time spent and confidence never certify mastery.
For an enumerated assignment, address the reported weakness in its own steps/items: explain the rule during work, solve and check the actual answers, correct actual errors. Finishing the correctly explained/checked assignment is the bounded stopping point. A separate synthetic exercise, mandatory re-solve or second check of all already verified items needs a distinct accepted goal/evidence contribution, even if labeled explanation or confirmation. Otherwise leave it OPTIONAL or genuinely failure-triggered CONTINGENT; do not silently extend the assignment. Missing understanding needs concrete explanation of the assigned steps, not an automatic repeated set.
Every supplied scope node needs a disposition and specific contribution; preserve explicit exclusions and all later strategic scope. INCLUDED/VERIFY_FIRST/CREDITED/DEFERRED/EXCLUDED are the only dispositions. CREDITED needs owned scoped demonstrated-readiness evidence, never confidence, completion or planned shared work. CREDITED/DEFERRED/EXCLUDED also need their own reason field on that entry. Explain consequential sacrifice and uncertainty without inventing assessment weights or deadlines. For large scope, use concise specific contributions/reasons and meaningful grouped milestones, not a phase per node; concision cannot omit nodes. ROADMAP details only the next useful checkpoint (possibly a beginner prerequisite), not the whole eventual project. Strategic INCLUDED nodes need no booked activity now; forecasts are not Quests.
